Benchmark data
--------------

benchmark/corpus/ contains synthetic samples written for this project, plus
test values published by their issuers for exactly this purpose (payment-card
test numbers published by the card networks, and the example SSN published by
the US Social Security Administration). It contains no real personal data.

benchmarks/ contains harnesses that evaluate the detectors against public
research datasets. The datasets themselves are not redistributed here; each
harness downloads them and each retains its own license and terms.
